    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Identify State in the Game Dashboard\r\n\r\n1. Choose 4 parts of the app that show a value that can change.\r\n2. For each one:\r\n   - Draw a circle around it\r\n   - Write in the matching note:\r\n     - The value right now (starting state)\r\n     - What the user might do to change it\r\n     - What it might change to\r\n<br/>",
